SUMMARY:Arbor Evenings at the Arboretum
DESCRIPTION:Not Dead Yet Asheville's Women in their 50s & 60s\nJoin us on 
 Wednesday July 22... Sip and stroll through the gardens at the Arboretum i
 n the glow of the golden hour\, all while ***listening to live music Celti
 c Road*** (Irish/Scottish instrumentals and songs).\nBring a chair!\nFor A
 rboretum members\, this event is free. Non members can carpool with a memb
 er\, or purchase a parking pass for $25.\nThere is no additional cost to a
 ttend ArborEvenings beyond the standard parking fee. As always\, Arboretum
  Society members and their accompanying guests can enter for FREE (guests 
 must be in member vehicles to receive free entry).\n\nThe carpooling meet 
 spot will be in the "At Home" store parking lot located at 980 Brevard Rd\
 , AVL 28806 **at 5:20**. Please add your interest in carpooling in the dis
 cussion space below. If you are a member and want to be a carpool host\, p
 lease also add your interest in the discussion area. Thanks!\n\nI have add
 ed a screenshot of the map to locate the meet and parking point for those 
 needing to carpool to the image gallery. Attendees should have received an
  email with the same.\n\n***\\*\\*Please note: Outside alcohol is prohibit
 ed on the campus of The North Carolina Arboretum.\\*\\****
